Package: HiddenTrunc
Type: Package
Title: Hidden Truncation Probability Distributions and Statistical Inference
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: person("Indranil", "Ghosh", email = "ghoshi@uncw.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Probability functions, random generation, likelihood-based inference,
    diagnostics, simulation, and Bayesian computation for probability models
    generated through hidden truncation. The initial release implements the
    upper-hidden-truncated Pareto type IV model and the two-sided
    hidden-truncated Arnold-Strauss bivariate exponential model, together with
    a generic hidden-truncation engine.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, graphics, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/ginni88/HiddenTrunc
BugReports: https://github.com/ginni88/HiddenTrunc/issues
